Substantial portions of the engineering skeleton (data catalog, immutable
snapshot writer, manifests, diff tooling, CLI scaffolding, scalars) are
modified derivatives of that project. The comparable-sales valuation core
(candidate selection, time adjustment, difference handling, robust
aggregation, interval calibration, review lineage, backtesting) is original
work written for the v1 release of this project, which was distributed under
the historical package name `compsval` (retired and renamed to
`gz_property_valuation` in v2). The quantified model layer introduced in v2
(B0/M1/GBM controlled comparisons, candidate operations with shadow records,
freeze & version fingerprinting, stop switch and fail-closed release gates)
is original work layered on that core.

